  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following on the common needs of the Employer and Business Membership Organizations in the countries of Eastern Europe and Central Asia, ILO will provide support to the EBMOs on creation of a membership strategy to complement country level activities as well as continue further individual work with the organizations in the relevant countries.</narrative>
  </description>
